		<published>2024-10-31T01:28:25</published>
		<id>http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4539&amp;p=33819#p33819</id>
		<link href="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4539&amp;p=33819#p33819"/>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[New OpenGD77 CPS 2024 10 31]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4539&amp;p=33819#p33819"><![CDATA[
There is a new version of the OpenGD77 CPS available<br><br><br><a href="https://www.opengd77.com/downloads/PC_CPS/Latest" class="postlink">downloads/PC_CPS/Latest</a><br><br>specifically<br><br><a href="https://www.opengd77.com/downloads/PC_CPS/Latest/OpenGD77CPSInstaller_R2024.10.31.01.exe" class="postlink">downloads/PC_CPS/Latest/OpenGD77CPSInst ... .31.01.exe</a><br><br>This version changes the "DMR ID" text on the Channel screen to show that this is an <strong class="text-strong">override </strong>to the Tx DMR ID.<br>Please note. <br>This setting should normally be empty, as its only used by people who have multiple DMR ID's and have specific reasons to use different DMR IDs on different channels.<br>You should NEVER enter the repeater DMR ID or anyone elses DMR ID into this box.<br><br><br>Also. The installer now waits for the COM driver to complete before continuing, as Windows 11 driver installation can take quite a long time, and its possible that the driver was not being fully installed becasue the CPS was not waiting for the driver installer bat file to complete<br><br>If you are updating the CPS from a previous version, there is normally no need to re-install the COM driver again, so you can uncheck that option in the installer.  However re-installing never normally causes a problem<br><br><br>The CPS localisation files have also been updated, because of the addition line of text that has been added.<br>Speficially<br><br>This line<br><div class="codebox"><p>CODE: </p><pre><code>&lt;Control Id="lblOverrideTxDMRId" Text="Override Tx DMR ID" /&gt;</code></pre></div><br>See<br><br><a href="https://www.opengd77.com/downloads/localisation/CPS" class="postlink">downloads/localisation/CPS</a><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Thu Oct 31, 2024 1:28 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
